Note on game assets and trademarks

This license covers the source code in this repository only.

"三國志Ⅸ with 威力加強版" (Romance of the Three Kingdoms IX with Power-Up Kit)
and all of its assets, artwork, text and trademarks are the property of
Koei Tecmo Games. This project ships no game data and requires a legitimate
copy of the game to run. Small button template crops under `config/templates/`
are derived from game screenshots and are required for UI automation to work;
they are included for interoperability purposes only.
